cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Buildings.city: A Local-First Urban Building Energy Modeling Platform"
message: "If you use Buildings.city in research, teaching, public-sector work, or project development, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software

authors:
  - name: "City Syntax Lab"

repository-code: "https://github.com/City-Syntax/buildings.city"
url: "https://buildings.city"

abstract: >
  Buildings.city is a local-first software platform for creating interactive
  Urban Building Energy Modeling (UBEM) applications from city-scale building
  datasets. Version 2.0 supports data-driven building visualization, configurable
  energy and carbon metrics, missing archetype prediction through a local ML API,
  EnergyPlus-backed simulation workflows through a local simulation API, and
  synchronization of reviewed outputs back into the active GeoJSON dataset.

keywords:
  - urban building energy modeling
  - UBEM
  - local-first software
  - building energy simulation
  - EnergyPlus
  - archetype prediction
  - GeoJSON
  - Mapbox
  - urban analytics
  - embodied carbon
  - operational energy

license: MIT
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-05-16
